The final implementation should deliver a secure, consistent, responsive, and enterprise-grade QKMS experience in which displayed metrics, inventory records, lifecycle states, governance results, rotation operations, quantum-readiness classifications, and risk findings are traceable to authoritative application data.

**Accuracy, verified functionality, security, and data integrity take priority over visual appearance. No fabricated data, false success messages, misleading compliance claims, or unsupported production-readiness assertions are acceptable.**